# The hermes-agent commit the Hermes web panel is built from.
#
# CI builds apps/desktop/dist-webapp at this commit and packs it into the APK
# (`.github/actions/hermes-webapp-bundle`); the sandbox installs Hermes at the
# same commit, so the panel and the backend it talks to are one version. The
# phone cannot build the bundle itself: `pnpm install` of the renderer dies under
# proot's --link2symlink, which dpkg needs (t_cf73367d).
#
# Bumping this is the only way to move the panel: both halves read this file.
ae2a81ccc00e9b7c06301523e5bb09608397149c
